@startuml
title Test levels: many small tests at the bottom, few large ones at the top

skinparam rectangle {
  roundCorner 6
}

rectangle "End-to-end tests (TE2E)\nthe critical paths, on the deployed platform\nminutes each, a handful" as E #FFCDD2
rectangle "Integration tests (TI)\none adapter against the real technology,\nor several services together: the saga scenarios\nseconds to minutes each, some dozens" as I #FFE0B2
rectangle "Component tests (TC)\none service, its real adapters in containers, neighbors simulated\nseconds each, about a hundred" as C #FFF8E1
rectangle "Unit tests (TU)\nthe domain alone: no framework, no database, no clock\nmilliseconds each, many hundreds" as U #C8E6C9

E -[hidden]down-> I
I -[hidden]down-> C
C -[hidden]down-> U

note right of E
  Proves: the platform works
  for a customer
end note
note right of I
  Proves: the pieces work
  with the real technology,
  and together
end note
note right of C
  Proves: a service keeps
  its contract
end note
note right of U
  Proves: every business rule,
  every cell of every state grid
end note
@enduml
